(label "VBAT_ESTOP" (at 363.22 246.38 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0e25fa10-c30b-4b74-b89d-85acddf3a953"))
(text "ENGINE I/O CARD (dedicated keyed slot, card type 0x0001)\nKey: engine-only coding notch in the card edge + matching rib in the engine slot guide;\nLV cards have the LV notch. ID EEPROM type check too.\nFuel/crank/glow drivers are fed ONLY from VBAT_ESTOP (E-stop cut is external, upstream\nof J23 on the mainboard).\nFUEL_EN/CRANK_EN/GLOW_EN arrive already gated by WD_OK on the mainboard (U38-U40).\nMissing card = no drive = engine stops.\nContacts: VBAT_ESTOP 12 in parallel (24 A rated, 12 A at 50 % derate >= 10 A F2 fuse);\nFUEL_OUT and CRANK_OUT 6 each (12 A / 6 A derated >= 6.14 A max SCP trip).\nGlow driver (baseline U47) VS moved VBAT_P -> VBAT_ESTOP (Nov 23 decision): E-stop now\nalso cuts glow.\nSlot pinout table: cards/engine/engine_slot_pinout.csv. b-row signals are GND guards.\nPRESENT_N tied to GND on the card." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 292 209.01 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e3957f7f-6cb6-427f-ab38-330c66194a36"))
